# SD Core for Linux documentation
#
# THE MARKDOWN IS THE SOURCE.  The .html and .pdf beside the markdown are
# generated by the tools in tools/ and are not tracked - a rendered copy would
# only add a way for the two to disagree, and each PDF is about 200KB, so a
# one-word fix would become a quarter-megabyte of unreadable diff.
*.html
*.pdf
*.zip

# Linux shell/editor litter
*~
.DS_Store

# Python's byte-cache for tools/.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
